  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yf2zDmUq\">用于获取千川投放账户下创建的随心商品投放全域订单列表， 默认可以拉取全部订单，支持过滤拉取部分订单</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201834005055840387%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201748264006369288%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-F5paJVFL\" id=\"h346b9f0-F5paJVFL\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-GWD3ieHh\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/aweme/uni_promotion/order/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/aweme/uni_promotion/order/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1834797699331148\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-645i07lD\" id=\"h346b9f0-645i07lD\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-8nMYSWIT\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-RSvsAH0o\" id=\"h346b9f0-RSvsAH0o\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Oh64Si0U\" id=\"h346b9f0-Oh64Si0U\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">千川客户id</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">marketing_goal</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">营销目标，允许值： <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-ak1kF3i8\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7gCIAct6\"><code>VIDEO_PROM_GOODS</code> 商品全域</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9gOPvBtb\">过滤器</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">status</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">按订单状态过滤，允许值：<br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-ZRtHJyNq\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-SpHfrKmE\"><code>AUDIT</code> 审核中</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-d3DhZwdj\"><code>BOOK</code> 未开播</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-FDCxpXTL\"><code>CREATING</code> 已支付，计划创建中</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-SPrKX0Xk\"><code>DELIVERY_OK</code> 投放中</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-jNErBsyk\"><code>FAILED</code> 计划创建失败</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PWEUMBEp\"><code>FINISHED</code> 投放完成</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-gVMW1U3S\"><code>FROZEN</code> 投放终止</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-FNF6nX4t\"><code>OFFLINE_AUDIT</code> 审核不通过</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ehu0Dd1O\"><code>OVER</code> 投放结束</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Xh1WdlNO\"><code>TIMEOUT</code> 未支付超过15分钟，订单关闭</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BAhb9IGO\"><code>UNPAID</code> 未支付</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Y25CzYCc\"><code>UNPAIDCANCEL</code> 未支付取消订单</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_create_start_date</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Q5YHRyoQ\">计划创建开始时间，格式：\"yyyy-mm-dd\"</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_create_end_date</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-AIJtYas5\">计划创建结束时间，与order_create_start_date搭配使用，格式：\"yyyy-mm-dd\"，时间跨度不能超过180天</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_field</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">排序字段，默认降序，允许值：<br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-W9dfQmBt\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ZMBVUVet\"><code>order_create_time</code> 创建时间从近到远（默认）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dREhzlnm\"><code>stat_cost_for_roi2</code> 整体消耗从高到低</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dhAOBkbv\"><code>total_pay_order_gmv_for_roi2</code> 成交金额从高到低</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4cYMWkLu\"><code>total_prepay_and_pay_order_roi2</code>  整体支付roi从高到低</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2nvy58q7s4o000\"><code>total_prepay_and_pay_settle_roi2_1h</code>净成交ROI从高到低</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1988lncsgyw000\"><code>total_order_settle_amount_for_roi2_1h</code>净成交金额从高到低\n</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">cursor</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QTLHTVD8\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">页码游标值，第一次拉取请传入0</span>，默认值<code>0</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">count</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> <span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">页面数据量，允许值：</span><code>10</code>、<code>20</code>、<code>50</code></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-QDOmKQYC\" id=\"h346b9f0-QDOmKQYC\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv1.0%2Fqianchuan%2Faweme%2Funi_promotion%2Forder%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20